      'To safely incorporate tinted sunscreen into daily routines, several principles help: (1) Apply 30 minutes before going outside to allow SPF activation. (2) Reapply every 2–3 hours, not just once. (3) Use mist-type SPF for oily areas. (4) Tinted sunscreen requires an extra cleansing step compared to regular sunscreen—double cleansing (cleansing oil + foam) effectively removes color particles. For those over 30, prioritize formulas combining UV protection with anti-aging ingredients (5% niacinamide, 10% vitamin C).',
