      'Leading matte lines in Korea include Amuse\'s "Powder Stay Matte," Hera\'s "Sensual Powder Matte," and Peripera\'s "Velvet Tint," all bestsellers. Globally, MAC\'s "Retro Matte" and Charlotte Tilbury\'s "Pillow Talk Matte" are standout products. Price ranges: Korea 18,000–35,000 KRW, global $30–50.',
