      'The Maximalist Eye is the polar opposite of minimal makeup, which uses a single restrained color. Unreal shades like neon pink, electric blue, lime green, and vivid orange are used two or three at a time. For the 2026 SS season, Instagram posts with the #maximalisteye hashtag increased by 415% year-on-year.',
