      'Market data shows the Maximalist Eye is the direct opposite of minimal trends like \'clean girl\' and \'glazed donut\' from 2024–2025. According to NPD Group\'s 2026 Q1 report, vivid eyeshadow line sales grew 89% year-on-year, while nude tones stagnated at 5%. In Korea, vivid color palettes from Amuse and Clio sold out within a week of launch, and Canmake in Japan and NYX in the US doubled their color ranges. Fashion brand collaborations (Versace, Moschino, Jacquemus, etc.) are also expanding the category with limited-edition colorful eyeshadow lines.',
