      'There are four key changes in second-generation cushions. First, metal or reinforced plastic cases improve hygiene and durability. Second, antibacterial-treated sponges (so-called “air-in padding”) inhibit bacterial growth. Third, SPF 50+/PA++++ is now standard, maximizing UV protection. Fourth, skincare ingredients like niacinamide and peptides are included, allowing continued skin care during makeup wear.',
