      'One key fact for consumers: some cushion foundation ingredients oxidize over time, causing color changes. It is recommended to use within six months after opening, and to clean the sponge monthly with lukewarm soapy water or replace it with a refill. If the surface darkens or the scent changes, replace immediately.',
      'Looking globally, while cushion foundation began in Korea, it is rapidly expanding in the US, Europe, and the Middle East. According to Sephora US’s 2025 quarterly data, cushion category sales rose +52% year-on-year, with 64% of first-time buyers being working women aged 25–34. Japan largely retains first-generation cushions, but in Southeast Asia, value-oriented K-cushions (A’pieu, Clio) are growing faster than luxury lines. In the US, luxury brands like Lancôme and Dior lead, but K-cushion brands are gaining share through competitive pricing.',
