      'Frosty Lipstick refers to lip products with fine pearl and metallic particles on the surface, creating a frosted, sparkling effect under light. Popularized by Britney Spears and Paris Hilton in the early 2000s, this look has made a comeback among Gen Z with the \'Y2K core\' trend.',
