      'As Glass Nails spread globally, derivative trends are rapidly diversifying. In Korea and Japan, \'Glass Ombre\'—a color gradient finished with a glass tone—is emerging, while in Europe, more subdued \'Matte Glass\' tones are popular. At New York Fashion Week 2026 backstage, many looks featured light beige glass nails with subtle chrome accents, praised as a blend of minimalism and functional modernism. Based on search data, the fastest-growing demographic is women in their 30s (+180% year-on-year), expanding the trend from Gen Z to include office-working women in their 30s and 40s.',
